  :adr/authoritative_for ["yadori.cloudflare" "Cloudflare registrar mutation boundary"]
  :adr/body "Yadori exposes Cloudflare domain search, authoritative price check, registration status, auto-renew policy and DNS request builders through an injected host transport. Search never authorizes purchase. A billable, non-refundable registration is permitted only after member Passkey approval of the exact Check quote, followed by an immediate second Check; any availability, registration-price, renewal-price, currency or tier change refuses before POST /registrations. Credentials remain host-held, premium registration fails closed, and manual renew, transfer and contact update remain explicitly unsupported while the Cloudflare Registrar API is beta. Existing G2/G3/G5/G6/G7/G9 gates remain in force."}]
